Subject: [PATCH] 9705: Debugger: Mark the tracked location in the Decompiler

Mark the location tracked by the primary dynamic listing, usually the PC, in the Decompiler, independent of the caret. The tokens of the instruction at that location get the tracked-register background, and their lines get the tracked-register icon (#9697).

The breakpoint margin becomes a generic Debugger icon margin, provided by DebuggerDecompilerMarginService, so breakpoints and the tracked location share one margin.
